  "content": "<p>Ur-Energy Inc. is a junior uranium mining company operating the Lost Creek in-situ recovery (ISR) uranium facility in south-central Wyoming. The company is engaged in the identification, acquisition, exploration, development, and operation of uranium projects. Since its inception, Ur-Energy has focused on low-cost, environmentally friendly ISR mining techniques to produce uranium oxide (U3O8). With a portfolio of projects primarily located in Wyoming, the company maintains a strong operational presence in the United States, aiming to provide a reliable domestic source of fuel for the nuclear power industry.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Cash\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Cash</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Executive Officer and President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Cash has served as Chairman of the Board since 2022 and as Chief Executive Officer and President since 2022. He previously served as Vice President of Regulatory Affairs, Exploration and Geology from 2011 to 2022. He has more than 30 years of experience in the uranium industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Roger%20Smith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Roger Smith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Smith has served as Chief Financial Officer since 2007 and as Chief Administrative Officer since 2011. He has over 35 years of experience in finance and accounting, primarily in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Steven%20Hatten\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Steven Hatten</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hatten has served as Chief Operating Officer since 2022. He previously served as Vice President of Operations from 2011 to 2022. He has over 30 years of experience in the uranium industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Peni%20Goff-Snyder\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Peni Goff-Snyder</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">General Counsel and Corporate Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Goff-Snyder has served as General Counsel and Corporate Secretary since 2011. She has over 25 years of legal experience, with a focus on corporate and securities law.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Boberg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Boberg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Former President, Chief Executive Officer, and Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Boberg is a co-founder of the Company and served as President and CEO from 2006 to 2011. He is a professional geologist with over 50 years of experience.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Cash\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Cash</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">March 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Cash has served as Chairman of the Board since 2022 and as Chief Executive Officer and President since 2022. He previously served as Vice President of Regulatory Affairs, Exploration and Geology from 2011 to 2022.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jeffrey%20Klenda\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jeffrey Klenda</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2004</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Klenda is a co-founder of the Company and served as Chairman and CEO from 2015 to 2022. He has over 40 years of experience in the financial and mining sectors.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Boberg\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Boberg</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2004</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Boberg is a co-founder of the Company and served as President and CEO from 2006 to 2011. He is a professional geologist with over 50 years of experience.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Thomas%20Parker\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Thomas Parker</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Parker has over 50 years of experience in the mining industry, including executive roles at High Plains Uranium and Anderson & Schwab.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gary%20Huber\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gary Huber</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Huber has over 40 years of experience in the natural resources industry and has served on several public company boards.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kathy%20Walker\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kathy Walker</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Walker is the President and CEO of Elm Street Resources Inc. and has over 35 years of experience in the energy industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Rob%20Chang\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Rob Chang</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Chang is the CEO of Gryphon Digital Mining and has over 25 years of experience in the financial and mining sectors.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1375201/000155837024002574/urg-20231231x10k.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Ur-Energy Inc. Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-06)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.ur-energy.com/about-us/management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Ur-Energy Inc. Official Website - Management Team</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.ur-energy.com/about-us/board-of-directors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Ur-Energy Inc. Official Website - Board of Directors</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li></ul>"
    }
  ]
